<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasUUID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#cat> .
<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#comprisesCatalogueLine> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "comprises Catalogue Line"@en .
