<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasNetQuantity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The net quantity of the item that is contained in each consumable unit, excluding any packaging materials."@en .
<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasCustomerReference> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An identifier assigned by the Buyer used for internal routing purposes."@en .
<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#Catalogue> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasItemStandardID> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasPriceValidity> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "has Price Validity"@en .
