<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasSpecificPaymentArrangement> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Information about payment conditions applied to all items in the catalogue. Additional information: This property may need to be used together with the payment arrangements provided in the ContractTerms, where such terms exists. (epo-cat:Catalogue)"@en .
<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasCertification> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
