<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#ItemModel> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A specific design or version of a product or service. Additional information: This class is meant as a reusable reference to the model name rather than as a set of specifications of an Item of this particular model."@en .
