<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasPriceDiscountInformation> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "has Price Discount Information"@en .
<http://data.europa.eu/a4g/ontology#hasTransactionConditions> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Textual description of the specific transaction conditions (purchasing, sales, payment, delivery) for an item. (epo-cat:CatalogueLine)"@en .
